0..72 Comment "// #2687: a workspace is the packages its `workspace.gandr` names, found"
73..152 Comment "// above them. It is not a package: it states what its members share as a model"
153..231 Comment "// of `Gandr.Workspace`, which each member\'s package source imports, and names"
232..311 Comment "// its members, each a directory below it rooting a package. `gandr check` here"
312..390 Comment "// checks this source and every member, and writes each member\'s `gandr.toml`."
